{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37466","headline":"秋晚高楼 · 唐彦谦","name":"秋晚高楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松拂疎窗竹映阑，素琴幽怨不成弹。\n清宵霁极云离岫，紫禁风高露满盘。\n晚蝶飘零惊宿雨，暮鸦淩乱报秋寒。\n高楼瞪目归鸿远，如信嵇康欲画难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}